{"ts":"2026-08-16T10:50:36.737Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"736bc2ce37b57aa429143ced","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-f6zjpq","claim:pm-suhxny","lineage:pm-f6zjpq","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-f6zjpq+pm-suhxny","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-f6zjpq","claim:pm-suhxny","lineage:pm-f6zjpq","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.233","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-3crymx"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"A declared context intent returns no context when combined with the narrowing flag, and its refusal receipt reports 122 tokens against a 2400 budget as the reason it does not fit"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Measured 2026-08-16 on this tracker. pm context --for orient returns context (7832 bytes, ~1958 tok, under its declared 2400 ceiling). pm context --for orient --limit 10 returns no context at all: budget_exceeded.omitted_result true, reason declared_budget_infeasible. Adding the narrowing flag destroys the answer. The emitted receipt then reports estimated_tokens 122 against token_budget 2400 with within_budget false and declaration_feasible false, because the final updateContextIntentEstimate call in applyContextIntentProjection re-estimates over the refusal object it just built, overwriting the estimate that justified the refusal. The number shown is not the number compared. Both named recoveries are also wrong: narrowing the request is what caused the omission, and --token-budget 20000 still omits. --token-budget 200000 succeeds and emits estimated_tokens 132522 under an intent whose declaration is 2400, because an explicit budget replaces the declared ceiling rather than being bounded by it."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:cli","area:context","context-management","receipts","token-budget"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-16T10:50:36.737Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-16T10:50:36.737Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A refusal receipt reports the estimate that produced the refusal, never an estimate recomputed over the refusal itself, and a test asserts the reported estimated_tokens exceeds token_budget whenever result_omitted is true; Applying an explicit row bound to a declared intent never produces a smaller result set and a larger reported cost than the same intent without it; Recovery guidance for an infeasible declaration names a recovery that is verified to work on the corpus that produced the refusal, rather than a generic instruction; An explicit --token-budget above a declared intent ceiling either is refused, is clamped to the declaration, or emits an explicit receipt field stating that the declaration was overridden and by how much; A negative control proves each assertion fails when the defect is reintroduced"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-mpbb"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A declared intent bounds a read and reports honestly why, and narrowing the request never removes the answer."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"context --for orient --limit 10 omits the result entirely and justifies it with a number 20x under the bound it claims to have exceeded."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-4k6b","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-16T10:50:36.737Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-7hbfch","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-16T10:50:36.737Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-ai45y9","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-16T10:50:36.737Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-prsvjh","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-16T10:50:36.737Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-yekkvt","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-16T10:50:36.737Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"837b483416fb3dbe34dd4c6436c6209af0616e17389e3319050740176d5f23f5","item_hash_version":2,"message":"Filed from a direct probe of the intent layer while measuring routing costs for the agent skills"}
