{"ts":"2026-08-16T10:51:21.338Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"736bc2ce37b57aa429143ced","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-f6zjpq","claim:pm-suhxny","lineage:pm-f6zjpq","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-f6zjpq+pm-suhxny","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-f6zjpq","claim:pm-suhxny","lineage:pm-f6zjpq","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.233","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-16T10:51:21.338Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-16T10:51:21.338Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Reproduction, exact commands and observed bytes on this tracker at tree 9da5886cc:\n\n  pm context --limit 10                              7,988 B  ~1,997 tok  result returned\n  pm context --for orient                            7,832 B  ~1,958 tok  result returned, budget 2400\n  pm context --for orient --limit 10                   520 B              RESULT OMITTED\n  pm context --for orient --limit 50                   520 B              RESULT OMITTED\n  pm context --for orient --token-budget 20000         521 B              RESULT OMITTED\n  pm context --for orient --token-budget 200000    448,564 B  ~112k tok   result returned, receipt says estimated_tokens 132522\n  pm context --for handoff                           4,588 B              result returned\n  pm context --for handoff --limit 10                  524 B              RESULT OMITTED\n\nThe receipt for the omitted case, verbatim: token_budget 2400, estimated_tokens 122, within_budget false, declaration_feasible false, result_omitted true, degradation budget_receipt_only.\n\nThree separable defects in one path: (1) the reported estimate is recomputed over the refusal so it contradicts the verdict it accompanies; (2) --limit turns a feasible intent infeasible on both declared context intents; (3) an explicit --token-budget replaces the declared ceiling instead of being bounded by it, so the same intent that declares 2400 emits 132522 with no field saying the declaration was overridden.\n\nThis is the fifth defect landed against the declared-intent layer after pm-ai45y9, pm-7hbfch, pm-prsvjh and pm-yekkvt. pm-yekkvt's AC4 already forbids recovery guidance that points at the unprojected command when that form is larger; here the unprojected form is SMALLER and succeeds, so the guidance is wrong in the direction that AC did not anticipate."}]}],"before_hash":"eccfd0ae23ce49606774f2ac06d8b6391c9e479a86c4fbdc43124c7f569abae2","after_hash":"479fb7812813df8ab9e60a886386b97774a47f652f92adaec409802c7eec94df","item_hash_version":2}
